# Did not exist before — without it, `COPY . .` in the Dockerfile's builder
# stage picked up a developer's local .env (real secrets) and baked it into
# a build layer that ends up in any registry the image is pushed to, plus
# unnecessary node_modules/.next bloat slowing every build.
node_modules
.next
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.vscode
coverage
